WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.460
Conspiracy theories have been around for a
long time.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:12.210
However, a new set of political conspiracies is gaining
traction as a growing number of Americans

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.930
appear ready to embrace these fantastic and
sometimes dangerous ideas.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:20.110
Not all Americans appear equally likely to believe in conspiracies.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.570
They tend to be more common on the political right.

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.480
But one group appears particularly susceptible.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:30.050
A new survey finds that white evangelical
Protestants are consistently more likely than

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:35.938
other Americans to embrace political conspiracies,
whether it is QAnon or the Deep State.

00:00:35.938 --> 00:00:39.425
There are a few reasons for this: First, white evangelicals

00:00:39.425 --> 00:00:42.750
are more socially segregated than other
Americans — they are more likely to be

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.570
surrounded by people who share their politics.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:49.310
This means their views tend to be reinforced,
rather than challenged.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:53.910
Second, they share a deep and abiding trust in
Donald Trump, who has well-documented history

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.212
of trafficking in these conspiracies
and engaging in falsehoods.

00:00:57.212 --> 00:01:01.900
And finally, white evangelicals are uniquely distrustful
of the mainstream media, making them more

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:06.196
likely to seek out alternative sources of
information about news and politics.

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:11.687
Do you see the rise of political conspiracies in the US posing a unique threat to our society?

00:01:11.687 --> 00:01:16.314
Let us know in our poll. Also, let us know what other topics
you'd like our scholars to cover in 60 seconds,

00:01:16.314 --> 00:01:21.000
and be sure to LIKE and SUBSCRIBE for more research and videos from AEI.

